# Vendored Godot conformance corpus — must stay byte-identical to the vendored Godot source.
# The corpus is LF-only. On a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true, Git would
# rewrite these to CRLF, which shifts every byte offset and breaks the conformance
# harness's span/message matching. Pin LF so that can never happen.
*.gd  text eol=lf
*.out text eol=lf
